  {
    "id": 1028001010020,
    "speaker": "はるき",
    "text": "このあと出るので、見にきてください",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "haruki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102800101/1028001010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとう……！\r\n──フライヤーもいいですね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1028001010030,
    "speaker": "はるき",
    "text": "ほんとですか？\r\nなんども書き直して大変だったのでうれしいです",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "haruki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102800101/1028001010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え、まさか君がこれを？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "haruki",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "へえ、すごいな……！\r\n演奏もするんだよね。それは──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1028001010040,
    "speaker": "はるき",
    "text": "ベースです\r\nまだまだ付け焼き刃なんですけど──",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "haruki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102800101/1028001010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1028001010050,
    "speaker": "はるき",
    "text": "実は、友達にメンバーが足りないからって\r\n頼まれて……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "haruki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102800101/1028001010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1028001010060,
    "speaker": "はるき",
    "text": "いっぱい練習して、初めてのステージなんです",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "haruki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102800101/1028001010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうなのか……！\r\n友達のためとはいえ、ガッツがあるね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1028001010070,
    "speaker": "はるき",
    "text": "ふふ～",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "haruki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102800101/1028001010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "話しかけてしまったけど\r\nライブ前の集中を乱してしまったかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
